#include \(dqserver.h\(dq

int debug_handle_message(int rfd, int wfd, const char *payload);
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Dispatches debug control messages received on \f[CR]CHAN_DEBUG\f[R]
(channel 4).
Called from \f[CR]json_session_handle()\f[R] whenever a frame arrives on
channel 4.
.PP
On the first call (if debug state is not yet initialized), this function
auto\-initializes by calling \f[CR]debug_init(rfd, wfd)\f[R].
The client file descriptors are updated on every call to handle
potential changes.
.PP
The message type is determined by the \f[CR]\(dqtype\(dq\f[R] field in
the JSON payload.
Supported message types:
.PP
